  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/994247/description_f2e0acd2-3441-4d3c-98f3-df75fdacdce0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"201\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（请查看图片选项卡）</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/994247/description_dac125c5-8359-4e95-a9c3-4bd0cca96d36.png\" alt=\"Sophisticated Backpacks 的更佳图形界面\" width=\"672\" height=\"588\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>关联模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">我能将其用于我的整合包吗？</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">当然！没问题，但如果您能保留作者信息，我将不胜感激。<br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此材质包可与“</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Lopy's Create Style Sophisticated Backpacks”材质包完美搭配</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>如有任何问题或建议，欢迎在官方 Discord 频道留言：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bGfyh9EXrT\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord！</a></em></span><br><br></strong></p>",
